WEBVTT

1
00:00:32.916 --> 00:00:35.750
In this verse, Lord Krishna explains

2
00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:37.833
how a yogi can attain Him at the time of death

3
00:00:37.833 --> 00:00:40.500
through disciplined practice.

4
00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:42.583
In the coming verses,

5
00:00:42.583 --> 00:00:45.625
He will explain this subject

6
00:00:45.625 --> 00:00:47.958
in even more detail.

7
00:00:52.916 --> 00:00:54.500
Krishna emphasizes  the importance of

8
00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:57.541
prayāṇa-kāla, meaning death's moment.

9
00:00:57.541 --> 00:00:59.416
This is that decisive time

10
00:00:59.416 --> 00:01:00.625
which determines

11
00:01:00.625 --> 00:01:03.125
the soul's next destination.

12
00:01:03.125 --> 00:01:04.500
Krishna explains that 

13
00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:07.083
the mind should become unwavering,

14
00:01:07.083 --> 00:01:12.208
which he calls, manasā acalena.

15
00:01:12.208 --> 00:01:14.916
This stability isn't easily obtained,

16
00:01:14.916 --> 00:01:17.541
because the mind by nature is restless.

17
00:01:17.541 --> 00:01:20.416
Therefore, to stabilize the mind,

18
00:01:20.416 --> 00:01:23.708
disciplined practice is needed throughout life.

19
00:01:23.708 --> 00:01:26.833
Krishna mentions bhaktyā yukto,

20
00:01:26.833 --> 00:01:30.375
showing that devotion is
 essential in this practice.

21
00:01:30.375 --> 00:01:31.458
Devotion is what

22
00:01:31.458 --> 00:01:34.041
flows the mind toward Him

23
00:01:34.041 --> 00:01:34.916
and nourishes

24
00:01:34.916 --> 00:01:36.000
the power needed

25
00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:38.833
for spiritual advancement.

26
00:01:38.833 --> 00:01:40.250
Yoga-balena –

27
00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:42.291
this phrase shows

28
00:01:42.291 --> 00:01:44.500
that to control the mind,

29
00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:48.083
mental and physical discipline is needed,

30
00:01:48.083 --> 00:01:51.875
developed through continuous effort in yoga.

31
00:01:51.875 --> 00:01:54.083
The yogi strengthens the mind

32
00:01:54.083 --> 00:01:55.958
by practicing yoga,

33
00:01:55.958 --> 00:01:57.541
ensuring

34
00:01:57.541 --> 00:02:00.250
that it doesn't waver,

35
00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:02.333
especially in life's final moments.

36
00:02:02.333 --> 00:02:06.791
Krishna then says, 
bhruvor madhye prāṇam āveśya,

37
00:02:06.791 --> 00:02:08.458
meaning the life force,

38
00:02:08.458 --> 00:02:09.833
meaning prāṇa,

39
00:02:09.833 --> 00:02:12.208
must be focused at the space
 between the eyebrows,

40
00:02:12.208 --> 00:02:15.250
known as the ājñā cakra.

41
00:02:15.250 --> 00:02:17.541
This technique is part of așṭāńga yoga

42
00:02:17.541 --> 00:02:20.416
and is necessary

43
00:02:20.416 --> 00:02:21.750
to raise consciousness

44
00:02:21.750 --> 00:02:24.625
to a higher spiritual state.

45
00:02:24.625 --> 00:02:26.458
It is essential.

46
00:02:26.458 --> 00:02:27.333
Finally,

47
00:02:27.333 --> 00:02:30.500
Krishna says that such a disciplined yogi

48
00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:33.833
who focuses unwaveringly on Him

49
00:02:33.833 --> 00:02:36.250
will attain the supreme state.

50
00:02:36.250 --> 00:02:38.875
This shows that through yoga's power

51
00:02:38.875 --> 00:02:40.250
and devotion's strength,

52
00:02:40.250 --> 00:02:44.750
the yogi can go beyond
 the material plane and obtain

53
00:02:44.750 --> 00:02:47.583
Lord Krishna's presence in the spiritual world.

54
00:02:52.333 --> 00:02:55.708
To obtain something important in life,

55
00:02:55.708 --> 00:02:57.291
you need power

56
00:02:57.291 --> 00:03:00.083
and concentration.

57
00:03:00.083 --> 00:03:03.625
This I call yoga-bala.

58
00:03:03.625 --> 00:03:08.250
This power doesn't come in one night;

59
00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:10.541
just as a tree slowly

60
00:03:10.541 --> 00:03:13.666
strengthens its roots,

61
00:03:13.666 --> 00:03:16.958
similarly this yoga-bala develops

62
00:03:16.958 --> 00:03:20.333
through continuous practice and discipline.

63
00:03:20.333 --> 00:03:24.291
If you want to stabilize your mind,

64
00:03:24.291 --> 00:03:26.375
want to obtain Me,

65
00:03:26.375 --> 00:03:30.291
or want to achieve any meaningful goal,

66
00:03:30.291 --> 00:03:33.083
then you must increase this inner strength

67
00:03:33.083 --> 00:03:37.583
through regular spiritual practice.

68
00:03:37.583 --> 00:03:41.083
Look, the mind is naturally restless,

69
00:03:41.083 --> 00:03:43.375
as you well know,

70
00:03:43.375 --> 00:03:46.666
like a lamp's flame

71
00:03:46.666 --> 00:03:48.583
wavers in gusts of wind.

72
00:03:48.583 --> 00:03:52.000
The mind always keeps 
getting distracted from the goal

73
00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:56.458
and attracted toward desires.

74
00:03:56.458 --> 00:04:00.333
Without yoga-bala, the 
mind will keep wandering.

75
00:04:00.333 --> 00:04:03.291
From this, keeping your focus

76
00:04:03.291 --> 00:04:06.500
on higher purpose will become difficult.

77
00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:08.125
Think,

78
00:04:08.125 --> 00:04:10.208
is this truth only

79
00:04:10.208 --> 00:04:13.291
for the spiritual path?

80
00:04:13.291 --> 00:04:14.750
No!

81
00:04:14.750 --> 00:04:19.791
This fact is useful in every area of life.

82
00:04:19.791 --> 00:04:21.250
Whether you're pursuing

83
00:04:21.250 --> 00:04:24.000
advancement goals in professional life,

84
00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:26.166
nurturing relationships,

85
00:04:26.166 --> 00:04:29.458
or moving toward personal development,

86
00:04:29.458 --> 00:04:32.208
you need a stable

87
00:04:32.208 --> 00:04:35.333
and focused mind.

88
00:04:35.333 --> 00:04:38.000
Just as an archer practices

89
00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:41.750
to keep their attention steady on the target,

90
00:04:41.750 --> 00:04:44.708
similarly a yogi practices

91
00:04:44.708 --> 00:04:45.750
throughout life

92
00:04:45.750 --> 00:04:49.791
to make their mind unwavering

93
00:04:49.791 --> 00:04:51.916
in the final moment.

94
00:04:51.916 --> 00:04:54.416
You too should develop

95
00:04:54.416 --> 00:04:58.375
such continuity in your efforts.

96
00:04:58.375 --> 00:04:59.916
Take out time daily

97
00:04:59.916 --> 00:05:03.250
for prayer, meditation, 
or any kind of spiritual practice.

98
00:05:03.250 --> 00:05:06.000
Do this regularly.

99
00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:10.791
These practices connect you with your real form.

100
00:05:10.791 --> 00:05:15.333
This routine will strengthen your inner resolve.

101
00:05:15.333 --> 00:05:18.833
Will provide you clear vision

102
00:05:18.833 --> 00:05:21.500
to face challenges.

103
00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:24.416
When you make this effort,

104
00:05:24.416 --> 00:05:27.291
then you build that yoga-bala

105
00:05:27.291 --> 00:05:31.166
which guides you in both

106
00:05:31.166 --> 00:05:34.583
life's rise and fall.

107
00:05:34.583 --> 00:05:37.958
This inner strength becomes the foundation

108
00:05:37.958 --> 00:05:42.583
on which all your successes rest.

109
00:05:42.583 --> 00:05:45.250
This inner strength not only brings you 

110
00:05:45.250 --> 00:05:47.333
steadily toward Me 

111
00:05:47.333 --> 00:05:52.166
but also steadily takes you toward
 any other meaningful goal you set.

112
00:05:52.166 --> 00:05:57.083
It moves you steadily toward it.

113
00:05:57.083 --> 00:06:01.250
As you walk on this path,
 you'll find that your mind

114
00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:05.458
keeps getting illuminated

115
00:06:05.458 --> 00:06:09.166
by that divine radiance

116
00:06:09.166 --> 00:06:12.458
which was always present within you.

117
00:06:17.208 --> 00:06:20.458
Have you ever thought

118
00:06:20.458 --> 00:06:23.458
in life's final test

119
00:06:23.458 --> 00:06:28.666
how your family can be helpful?

120
00:06:28.666 --> 00:06:30.708
In family life,

121
00:06:30.708 --> 00:06:34.500
it's extremely necessary to understand

122
00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:40.083
that the greatest test of mind's control

123
00:06:40.083 --> 00:06:44.041
will be at the time of death.

124
00:06:44.041 --> 00:06:46.250
How you prepare for

125
00:06:46.250 --> 00:06:49.041
that decisive moment

126
00:06:49.041 --> 00:06:52.291
depends on what kind of life

127
00:06:52.291 --> 00:06:56.625
you live in the present.

128
00:06:56.625 --> 00:06:58.541
I want you to adopt

129
00:06:58.541 --> 00:07:01.958
such a lifestyle

130
00:07:01.958 --> 00:07:06.500
that strengthens your mind and heart,

131
00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:09.291
that prepares you

132
00:07:09.291 --> 00:07:12.666
for that final test.

133
00:07:12.666 --> 00:07:16.250
Family members should help each other

134
00:07:16.250 --> 00:07:18.708
develop habits of

135
00:07:18.708 --> 00:07:22.333
spiritual practice.

136
00:07:22.333 --> 00:07:24.541
Encourage each other in daily prayer, meditation,

137
00:07:24.541 --> 00:07:26.875
and reading religious books.

138
00:07:26.875 --> 00:07:30.208
Encourage each other.

139
00:07:30.208 --> 00:07:32.708
Create such an environment

140
00:07:32.708 --> 00:07:37.541
where My name and stories resonate daily.

141
00:07:37.541 --> 00:07:41.333
This creates mental discipline

142
00:07:41.333 --> 00:07:43.083
that keeps practicing

143
00:07:43.083 --> 00:07:45.083
to keep the mind stable.

144
00:07:45.083 --> 00:07:49.166
Life's ups and downs will certainly come,

145
00:07:49.166 --> 00:07:52.125
like in a river sometimes flood,

146
00:07:52.125 --> 00:07:54.958
sometimes drought comes,

147
00:07:54.958 --> 00:07:57.500
but living while focusing

148
00:07:57.500 --> 00:08:01.541
on spiritual strength

149
00:08:01.541 --> 00:08:04.750
prepares you and your family well

150
00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:06.416
for the final

151
00:08:06.416 --> 00:08:08.875
pleasant result.

152
00:08:08.875 --> 00:08:11.416
You should understand

153
00:08:11.416 --> 00:08:14.916
that for 'I always remain in remembrance,'

154
00:08:14.916 --> 00:08:19.083
all people of the family will need

155
00:08:19.083 --> 00:08:21.791
to maintain mental control

156
00:08:21.791 --> 00:08:24.000
over themselves.

157
00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:25.916
Although this control

158
00:08:25.916 --> 00:08:28.041
is difficult,

159
00:08:28.041 --> 00:08:30.750
through one method

160
00:08:30.750 --> 00:08:33.500
you all can help each other

161
00:08:33.500 --> 00:08:35.000
in obtaining

162
00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:37.250
this control.

163
00:08:37.250 --> 00:08:39.083
That method is

164
00:08:39.083 --> 00:08:43.250
building a good spiritual environment.

165
00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:45.958
In such an environment, everyone's mind

166
00:08:45.958 --> 00:08:50.125
starts coming toward Me with ease.

167
00:08:50.125 --> 00:08:52.583
This is that priceless gift

168
00:08:52.583 --> 00:08:56.166
you can give to your family.

169
00:08:56.166 --> 00:09:00.250
This will help them not only in this life

170
00:09:00.250 --> 00:09:04.291
but also in the journey to the supreme abode.

171
00:09:09.083 --> 00:09:11.125
In the work place,

172
00:09:11.125 --> 00:09:15.750
when you're ready to
 make an important decision,

173
00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:17.875
do you become distracted

174
00:09:17.875 --> 00:09:21.000
in the final moment?

175
00:09:21.000 --> 00:09:23.250
This is prayāṇa-kāla

176
00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:27.166
of your professional life.

177
00:09:27.166 --> 00:09:28.541
In your professional life,

178
00:09:28.541 --> 00:09:32.333
in moments of crisis,
 meaning your prayāṇa-kāla,

179
00:09:32.333 --> 00:09:35.166
two things

180
00:09:35.166 --> 00:09:38.000
are important –

181
00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:40.250
First,

182
00:09:40.250 --> 00:09:41.875
your dedication to work,

183
00:09:41.875 --> 00:09:45.000
meaning 'bhaktyā yukto,'

184
00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:48.916
and second, experience

185
00:09:48.916 --> 00:09:52.041
obtained from regular practice,

186
00:09:52.041 --> 00:09:55.458
meaning 'yoga-bala'!

187
00:09:55.458 --> 00:09:58.708
When challenges arise,

188
00:09:58.708 --> 00:10:01.791
these two qualities will determine

189
00:10:01.791 --> 00:10:04.375
how skillfully

190
00:10:04.375 --> 00:10:08.125
you solve them.

191
00:10:08.125 --> 00:10:10.333
Dedication means

192
00:10:10.333 --> 00:10:14.208
that even when circumstances
 become difficult,

193
00:10:14.208 --> 00:10:17.458
you remain engaged in achieving your goal.

194
00:10:17.458 --> 00:10:19.416
Becoming dejected or disappointed

195
00:10:19.416 --> 00:10:23.833
is easy, but true professional leaders

196
00:10:23.833 --> 00:10:24.875
in every situation,

197
00:10:24.875 --> 00:10:28.416
remain eager for goal achievement,

198
00:10:28.416 --> 00:10:30.333
remain concentrated,

199
00:10:30.333 --> 00:10:34.208
and remain deeply connected to their purpose.

200
00:10:34.208 --> 00:10:40.541
Just as I tell Arjuna to always
 keep Me in remembrance,

201
00:10:40.541 --> 00:10:43.125
similarly you too should always

202
00:10:43.125 --> 00:10:47.208
keep your aim in remembrance

203
00:10:47.208 --> 00:10:49.916
and keep obtaining proper guidance

204
00:10:49.916 --> 00:10:54.041
with true dedication.

205
00:10:54.041 --> 00:10:56.125
Also know this –

206
00:10:56.125 --> 00:11:00.083
dedication alone isn't sufficient.

207
00:11:00.083 --> 00:11:04.500
Yoga-bala is also expected from you –

208
00:11:04.500 --> 00:11:10.583
that capability which arises through
 practice continuous over time.

209
00:11:10.583 --> 00:11:18.250
The skills, knowledge, and 
discipline you develop daily

210
00:11:18.250 --> 00:11:20.875
are what prepare you

211
00:11:20.875 --> 00:11:25.083
to handle suddenly arrived circumstances,

212
00:11:25.083 --> 00:11:27.041
make you mature,

213
00:11:27.041 --> 00:11:31.583
with self-confidence and clarity!

214
00:11:31.583 --> 00:11:33.333
Think,

215
00:11:33.333 --> 00:11:36.125
can some singer

216
00:11:36.125 --> 00:11:39.875
skillfully hit all the notes

217
00:11:39.875 --> 00:11:41.625
in their very first performance?

218
00:11:41.625 --> 00:11:44.250
No.

219
00:11:44.250 --> 00:11:45.958
This mental firmness

220
00:11:45.958 --> 00:11:48.541
doesn't develop in one night;

221
00:11:48.541 --> 00:11:52.375
it's the result of continuous effort.

222
00:11:52.375 --> 00:11:54.250
Therefore, accomplish

223
00:11:54.250 --> 00:12:01.208
your work with both dedication and practice.

224
00:12:01.208 --> 00:12:04.791
Gradually increase your skills.

225
00:12:04.791 --> 00:12:09.416
In such time, when crisis comes, then you'll find

226
00:12:09.416 --> 00:12:11.375
that both the inner strength

227
00:12:11.375 --> 00:12:14.875
and concentration to handle it effectively

228
00:12:14.875 --> 00:12:19.750
are already present within you.

229
00:12:19.750 --> 00:12:22.333
This inner capability

230
00:12:22.333 --> 00:12:25.000
will be the guide to successfully

231
00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:32.208
bring you and your team out
 of any adverse circumstance.
